Umbral Platemail is the planar armor set for [[Shadow Knight|Shadow Knights]]. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 2|Group 2 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Hate]] and [[Plane of Fear]]. There does not appear to be a named mob that always drops two pieces of this armor.

